  "title": "Materion leverages tantalum expertise to serve the expanding semiconductor market",
  "summary": "Materion is leveraging its deep expertise in tantalum materials to support the expanding semiconductor market and the growing demand for advanced chips. Through vertically integrated capabilities and high-purity tantalum sputtering targets, Materion helps enable the performance, reliability, and scalability required for next-generation semiconductor technologies.",
